    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_ba94136e",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a young girl with an exaggerated expression of surprise or excitement, interacting with an adult woman who appears to be engaging with her in a playful or educational activity involving colorful blocks. The text overlay reads 'enriching the mind and body while also enriching our hearts,' which suggests a positive, nurturing, and holistic message about growth and connection. There is no visual or textual content that aligns with any of the listed toxic categories (Abusive, Cyberbullying, Harmful, Hateful, Mysogynous, Propaganda). The intent is to convey a wholesome, uplifting message about personal and emotional development through interaction and play, using the visual of a child and adult bonding as an analogy for the enriching process described in the text. The meme is intended to inspire or promote positive values without targeting any specific group or community in a derogatory manner.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_6d8c17b2"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
