      "instance_name": "holistic_development_concept",
      "label": "Holistic Development Concept",
      "description": "The phrase 'enriching the mind and body while also enriching our hearts' refers to a holistic approach to personal growth that integrates intellectual, physical, and emotional well-being. This concept is rooted in educational philosophies, parenting theories, and wellness movements that emphasize balanced development across multiple domains of life.",
