      "instance_name": "parenting_theory",
      "label": "Parenting Theory",
      "description": "The image and text imply a nurturing, interactive parenting style that promotes learning and emotional bonding through play. This aligns with developmental psychology theories (e.g., Vygotsky’s sociocultural theory) that emphasize the role of caregivers in cognitive and emotional development.",
